[{"name":"browser_evaluate","description":"在当前任务所属页面执行 JavaScript 表达式，定点读取 DOM、页面状态及已观察到的数据。只返回所需字段，避免整个 HTML；写入需有对应业务授权。大结果通过 browser_result 分页。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"expression":{"type":"string"},"args":{},"maxResponseChars":{"type":"integer"},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_cdp","description":"调用当前任务所属页面的 Chrome DevTools Protocol，支持 DOM、可访问性树、Network、Page 与浏览器上下文能力。cdpAction=send/subscribe/events/unsubscribe；method 为完整 CDP 方法名，params 为实际方法参数。只订阅需要的事件。大结果通过 browser_result 分页。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"cdpAction":{"type":"string","enum":["send","subscribe","events","unsubscribe"]},"method":{"type":"string"},"params":{"type":"object"},"events":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":20},"maxResponseChars":{"type":"integer"},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_storage","description":"读取或按明确授权修改当前页面的 localStorage、sessionStorage 或 Cookie。storageArea=local/session/cookies，storageAction=list/get/set/remove/clear；不输出无关账号数据。大结果通过 browser_result 分页。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"storageArea":{"type":"string","enum":["local","session","cookies"]},"storageAction":{"type":"string","enum":["list","get","set","remove","clear"]},"keys":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"name":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"},"cookies":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"origin":{"type":"string"},"maxResponseChars":{"type":"integer"},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_result","description":"读取当前任务保留的完整浏览器原结果。br_开头resultID为持久结果，重启后仍可按 offset/maxResponseChars 分页；action=list 按 offset/limit 列出本会话持久结果索引。operationID 查询仍在执行或迟到完成的脚本/CDP/存储结果。不要为取结果重放原操作。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"resultID":{"type":"string"},"operationID":{"type":"string"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"maxResponseChars":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"action":{"type":"string","enum":["read","list"]}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_table","description":"定点读取 HTML 表格或 ARIA grid，支持按行列分页、表头、合并单元格及虚拟表格行号。用已观察到的 selector/ref 定位表格。只读取已渲染行，虚拟滚动区域需要滚动后重读；不会把当前可见行误报为完整表格。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"selector":{"type":"string"},"ref":{"type":"string"},"rowOffset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"columnOffset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"maxRows":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100},"maxColumns":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":50},"maxCellChars":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":2000}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_editor","description":"读取、替换或在光标处插入纯文本，目标必须是真实 input、textarea 或 contenteditable 编辑区域，支持 iframe 和开放 Shadow DOM。editorAction=read/replace/insert，默认只读。通过浏览器输入事件操作并读回验证；verified 仅代表编辑区域内容，不代表服务器已保存。先观察真实编辑节点；未验证成功时不要盲目重发。画布或代码编辑器外壳不能直接填充。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"ref":{"type":"string"},"selector":{"type":"string"},"editorAction":{"type":"string","enum":["read","replace","insert"]},"text":{"type":"string"},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_tabs","description":"列出、选择或关闭浏览器的标签。先确认 tabId，不按标题猜测。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"action":{"type":"string","enum":["list","select","close"]}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_open","description":"在应用界面实际可见的浏览器标签打开 HTTP/HTTPS 网页；复用当前会话标签，newTab=true 才新建；直接返回页面 DOM 正文、refs 和分页状态，可用 maxTextChars/maxRefs 调整。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"},"newTab":{"type":"boolean"},"maxTextChars":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":50000},"maxRefs":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":500},"observationSelector":{"type":"string","description":"操作后需要读取的页面区域 CSS selector，与操作目标 selector 分开。"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_snapshot","description":"读取 DOM 正文、iframe/open Shadow DOM 元素与新鲜引用，不生成截图。支持 selector 与分页定点读取；结构化文档块需 includeDocument=true。open/act 已返回所需正文和 refs 时直接使用，不重复 snapshot。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"selector":{"type":"string"},"maxTextChars":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":50000},"maxRefs":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":500},"textOffset":{"type":"integer"},"refOffset":{"type":"integer"},"includeDocument":{"type":"boolean","description":"仅在需要提取完整结构化课稿、表格或公式文档时设 true；默认只返回有界 DOM 正文和元素。"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_inspect","description":"按明确 CSS 选择器检查控件、可见性、遮挡、几何、样式和状态，支持等待与断言。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"selector":{"type":"string"},"ref":{"type":"string"},"waitFor":{"type":"string","enum":["attached","detached","visible","hidden"]},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer"},"expect":{"type":"object"},"value":{"type":"string"},"minCount":{"type":"integer"},"styles":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"includeComponents":{"type":"boolean"},"maxResults":{"type":"integer"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_act","description":"使用最新 ref 操作网页：点击、输入、选择、勾选、悬停。steps 支持最多8步连续操作；导航、弹窗、下载或取消后停止。返回更新后的 DOM 正文、refs、changes，直接检查这些字段；不要只读取 execution 或丢弃结果再调用 snapshot。observationSelector/maxTextChars/maxRefs 控制操作后读取范围。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"ref":{"type":"string"},"selector":{"type":"string"},"interaction":{"type":"string","enum":["click","double_click","hover","type","select","check","uncheck"]},"text":{"type":"string"},"option":{"type":"string"},"steps":{"type":"array","maxItems":8,"items":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["type","select","check","uncheck","click","press_key"]},"ref":{"type":"string"},"selector":{"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"},"option":{"type":"string"},"key":{"type":"string"},"expect":{"type":"object"}},"required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false}},"expect":{"type":"object"},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer"},"observationSelector":{"type":"string","description":"操作后需要读取的页面区域 CSS selector，与操作目标 selector 分开。"},"maxTextChars":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":50000},"maxRefs":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":500}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_key","description":"向当前网页发送按键，返回实际状态。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"key":{"type":"string"},"expect":{"type":"object"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_pointer","description":"语义控件不能覆盖时执行坐标点击或实际滚轮滚动；优先使用snapshot给出的坐标。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"pointer":{"type":"string","enum":["click","double_click","scroll"]},"x":{"type":"number"},"y":{"type":"number"},"deltaX":{"type":"number"},"deltaY":{"type":"number"},"expect":{"type":"object"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_upload","description":"上传用户明确指定的绝对文件路径。使用已捕获的文件选择请求；没有请求时，先点击网页真实上传按钮或关联input，再调用上传。无需点击系统文件选择框；selectionConfirmed表示捕获的文件选择请求已接受文件，网站立即清空或替换控件不作为失败条件。uploadStatus=not-verified不代表服务器上传成功，须检查网页结果或上传请求响应；状态未知时不要盲目重复上传。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"files":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["files"]},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_dialog","description":"查看网页对话框状态。默认后台关闭普通提示、取消确认/输入、保留当前页处理离开确认，dialogNotice返回已处理结果；已关闭弹窗不要重复处理或自动重试肯定操作。可按明确授权接受或取消仍在等待的对话框。文件选择使用browser_upload，不能将系统选择框当作网页按钮。 连续弹窗使用 status 返回的 dialogId，避免操作已更新的弹窗。浏览器无法关闭原生弹窗时传 native=true；返回 requiresComputerUse 后接续本会话 cua_repl 工具，处理完必须重新观察并确认弹窗消失。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"decision":{"type":"string","enum":["status","accept","dismiss"]},"text":{"type":"string"},"native":{"type":"boolean"},"dialogId":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_downloads","description":"核对当前标签真实下载文件的完成/失败状态和实际路径。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_debug","description":"查看Console和Network，mode控制捕获；networkAction可检索请求、读取正文、条件等待、导出HAR和事件。优先检索已捕获的请求和响应正文，用接口读回核对页面状态。重放/Mock仅在用户明确要求时使用。抓包按当前会话隔离。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"mode":{"type":"string","enum":["status","start","stop","clear"]},"networkAction":{"type":"string","enum":["list","get","body","wait","export","clear","replay","mock","unmock"]},"recordID":{"type":"string"},"query":{"type":"string"},"resourceType":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"integer"},"parentID":{"type":"string"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"direction":{"type":"string","enum":["request","response"]},"jsonPath":{"type":"string"},"bodyState":{"type":"string"},"scope":{"type":"string","enum":["conversation","background"]},"method":{"type":"string","enum":["GET","POST","PUT","PATCH","DELETE"]},"url":{"type":"string"},"headers":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}},"body":{"type":"string"},"maxResponseChars":{"type":"integer"},"timeoutMs":{"type":"integer"},"minCount":{"type":"integer"},"maxResults":{"type":"integer"},"maxTextChars":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":50000}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_request","description":"仅对已经从 DOM/Network 观察到的接口，在真实网页登录会话内发起请求。读取内容优先 GET；写请求须有对应业务授权，不能猜接口、认证或绕过验证码。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"},"method":{"type":"string","enum":["GET","POST","PUT","PATCH","DELETE"]},"headers":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}},"body":{"type":"string"},"maxResponseChars":{"type":"integer"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}},{"name":"browser_screenshot","description":"将当前网页截图保存为项目内证据文件；普通文本与表单问题优先snapshot/inspect。","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tabId":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"openWorldHint":true}}]
